  - title: 02 / Locate a single fault
    explanation: "A 2.2 k\u03A9 lower resistor raises its midpoint to 3.44 V. A positive
      difference of +0.94 V with RIGHT at 2.50 V identifies the left lower arm. A
      negative difference of \u22120.94 V with LEFT at 2.50 V identifies the right
      lower arm. The drawing shows the left fault."
    caption: "DIFFERENCE = LEFT \u2212 RIGHT"
    parts:
    - id: supply
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.55}
      label: BATTERY +
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.34, b: 0.4, a: 1}
