  - title: 03 / Detect false balance
    explanation: "When both lower arms are 2.2 k\u03A9, their midpoints match at
      3.44 V. The differential meter reads 0.00 V. Compare each midpoint with the
      2.50 V baseline to find the two faults."
    caption: "BOTH MIDPOINTS ARE HIGH \u2022 DIFF IS STILL 0.00 V"
    parts:
    - id: supply
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.55}
