  - title: 04 / Repair and verify
    explanation: "Fit a 1 k\u03A9 cartridge to each lower arm. Replacing one first
      makes a signed difference appear again. Once both are replaced, check LEFT
      \u2248 2.50 V, RIGHT \u2248 2.50 V, and DIFF \u2248 0.00 V. Press VERIFY REPAIR
      to finish."
    caption: BOTH MIDPOINTS RETURN TO 2.50 V
